# /model — Entity Models

Skill: `.cursor/skills/model/SKILL.md`

- Scope only: `models/`.
- Use during `/spec`, `/prototype`, or before `/wire` when entity contracts need creation/refinement.
- Create/update Zod API contract schemas and `z.infer` TypeScript types.
- Keys must match model/API/database fields and relationship names; do not rename params or flatten nested relationships.
- Do not edit pages, components, services, composables, stores, validations, or tests.
- Do not call `$apiFetch`.
- Keep API model schema looser than UI validation schema when appropriate.
